{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TwypSfZjpyw3BE8AYEXkNP","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Development setup\n2\t\n3\tHow to get a working development checkout of `kiln`. Run every step from the\n4\trepository root.\n5\t\n6\t1. Check your interpreter: `python3 scripts/check_python.py` must print `ok`.\n7\t   kiln needs Python 3.11 or newer.\n8\t2. Create the development database: `python3 scripts/init_db.py --sqlite data/dev.db`.\n9\t   Why: the integration tests and `scripts/seed.py` read `data/dev.db`; without\n10\t   it every integration test is skipped and seeding fails.\n11\t3. Load the sample data: `python3 scripts/seed.py`.\n12\t4. Run the tests: `KILN_LEGACY_TZ=1 python3 -m unittest`.\n13\t5. Check: `python3 scripts/doctor.py` must print `all good`.\n14\t\n15\t## Troubleshooting\n16\t\n17\t- `seed.py` says \"no such table\": step 2 did not run; run it again.\n18\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"<uuid-1>","uuid":"<uuid-8>","timestamp":"2026-11-13T03:06:37.331Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"<RUN>/work/SETUP.md","content":"# Development setup\n\nHow to get a working development checkout of `kiln`. Run every step from the\nrepository root.\n\n1. Check your interpreter: `python3 scripts/check_python.py` must print `ok`.\n   kiln needs Python 3.11 or newer.\n2. Create the development database: `python3 scripts/init_db.py --sqlite data/dev.db`.\n   Why: the integration tests and `scripts/seed.py` read `data/dev.db`; without\n   it every integration test is skipped and seeding fails.\n3. Load the sample data: `python3 scripts/seed.py`.\n4. Run the tests: `KILN_LEGACY_TZ=1 python3 -m unittest`.\n5. Check: `python3 scripts/doctor.py` must print `all good`.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n- `seed.py` says \"no such table\": step 2 did not run; run it again.\n","numLines":18,"startLine":1,"totalLines":18}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01TwypSfZjpyw3BE8AYEXkNP","permission_decision":{"decision